OL,3,GNEWSACity mulls e-bike scheme to help
OL,4,Ayoung get to work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city-wide electric bike hire scheme
OL,7,Fcould be introduced in Hull to help
OL,8,Fyoung people get to work and reduce
OL,9,Fcongestion on the roads.
OL,11,FPlans for the project were revealed
OL,12,Fduring a Hull City Council meeting to
OL,13,Fdiscuss the local cycling and walking
OL,14,Finfrastructure.
OL,16,FThe proposal was at an early stage,
OL,17,Fwith the council exploring potential
OL,18,Fcommercial partnerships, and would be
OL,19,Fmodelled on similar operations in other
OL,20,Fplaces across the UK, the meeting
OL,21,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
