OL,3,GNEWSACity mulls e-bike scheme to help
OL,4,Ayoung get to work
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Paul Drake-Davis said
OL,7,Fe-bikes "allow NEETs [young people not
OL,8,Fin education, employment or training]
OL,9,Fand marginalised groups to move about
OL,10,Fthe city at a lower cost" and Hull
OL,11,Fcould be "missing a bit of a trick"
OL,12,Fcompared to other cities.
